[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17165.59, "timestamp": "04:46:05", "text": "無關緊要的事情。不，我把它放進去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17192.07, "timestamp": "04:46:32", "text": "。所以，這個在這裡，對吧？但當第二組兩個表情符號出現時，混亂就發生了。  就像……嗯……讓我想想。等等，我該怎麼表達「我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17194.27, "timestamp": "04:46:34", "text": "天哪」"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17200.75, "timestamp": "04:46:40", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17204.27, "timestamp": "04:46:44", "text": "嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17211.99, "timestamp": "04:46:51", "text": "我想我"}]